OpenType for Oberon (Erich Oswald) - TrueType and OpenType fonts: the font files, the interpreter
of their hinting instructions, and Oberon raster fonts made from them

  OTFonts.Make Arialb.TTF Arial b 10 12 14 Scn Pr3 ~   Oberon raster fonts Arial10b.Scn.Fnt and
                                                        so on from a TrueType font file
  OTFonts.Install           fonts made from OpenType files when they are asked for
  Desktops.OpenDoc OType.Text                           the documentation
